  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>NEW CUSTOM LUXURY Southern Seabreeze beach home heaven! Sleeps 12 guests. Ultra prime location within a few minutes walk to the beach, Seacrest pools, Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach, restaurants, and shopping.<br><br><br><br>Go with official Airbnb Superhosts! Please see our positive 100's past guest reviews!<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Newly built in 2018 custom luxury beach home with 5 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms. Step onto the charming back porch and in through the back door, and you're met with abundant natural light flowing into the open living room-kitchen concept equipped with modern comfort. A beautifully appointed kitchen with waterfall quartz stone island & countertops, custom lighting, and all professional stainless steel appliances. The back of the property is an expansive covered deck and grilling area complete with privacy fencing. It overlooks a beautiful backyard with a pool and across the street from the beach. Exceptional privacy, creating your personal backyard sanctuary. Perfect for entertaining guests and enjoying dinner outside.<br><br><br><br>Location, Location, Location. Walking distance to the beach (5min), Private Pool, Rosemary Beach (7min), Alys Beach (5min), restaurants (5min), shopping (1min), and all of 30A East has to offer. FREE Bicycles also available.<br><br><br><br>Plenty of space to sleep up to 12 people. Five spacious bedrooms adjoining to four bathrooms each uniquely designed. Truly a must vacation destination with all the attention to details in this spa-inspired modern tranquil beach home.<br><br><br><br>Sleeping Arrangements:<br><br>- Bedroom #1: 1 King bed<br><br>- (Master) Bedroom #2: 1 King bed<br><br>- Bedroom #3: 1 King bed<br><br>- Bedroom #4: 1 King bed<br><br>- Bedroom #5: 1 King bed and 1 Queen Bunk Bed<br><br><br><br>* Kitchen is stocked with all the dining ware and cooking tool essentials<br><br>* Plenty of clean linens and towel sets<br><br>* Full-size washer and dryer<br><br>* Includes private driveway for up to 4 vehicles. Additional street parking is available.<br><br>* Large screen HD TV's with all popular channels including HBO throughout home. TV’s in each bedroom, 75” TV in living area, 65\" TV on outdoor patio<br><br>* Outdoor Shower <br><br><br><br>Community:<br><br><br><br>* The Beach Home (right next door), Alys Beach, and Rosemary Beach, offer an array of excellent local restaurants and shopping options within walking distance.<br><br>*Very friendly and outgoing neighbors<br><br>* Miles of shaded walking trails winding through the community.<br><br>*In a safe and child friendly neighborhood<br><br><br><br>** ABSOLUTELY NO PETS, NO SMOKING INSIDE ALLOWED<br><br>** PERSON BOOKING AND CHECKING IN MUST BE AT LEAST AGE 23",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Seabreeze 30A: Luxe 5BR w/ Pool & Beach Access – Barclé"
        }
      ],
