            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your glowing review, Julie! We're thrilled to hear that three generations of your family had a wonderful week together at our home. It's fantastic that you found the open concept layout, outdoor patio, and pool to be perfect for your stay, and we're delighted that the proximity to the beach added to your enjoyment.\n\nWe truly appreciate your recommendation and look forward to welcoming you and your family back for another memorable stay in the future!",
