            "id": "6f751932-6db0-402d-8a95-4da68a36912b",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your fantastic review, Christine! We're thrilled to hear that you found our home beautiful and comfortable, with ample seating both indoors and outdoors for your group. It's wonderful that you appreciated the beach chairs, bikes, and the five king size beds, including the comfy one in the bunk room. We're also glad you enjoyed the amazing water pressure in the showers and found the short walk to the beach convenient, despite the stairs.\n\nWe truly appreciate your recommendation and look forward to welcoming you back again soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This home was SO beautiful and comfortable. Ample indoor and outdoor seating for our group of 5 adults. There were beach chairs and bikes and FIVE king size beds! Yes, even the bunk room had a soft and comfy king bed. Water pressure of the showers was amazing. VERY short walk to beach - stairs to navigate down to the beach - not a problem, just an FYI. Highly recommend this property!",
